<title>USA: American Residential Q3 pro forma net rises.</title>
<headline>American Residential Q3 pro forma net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pro Forma Combined Results of Operations/a</p>
<p>		  (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					  Three Months	Nine Months</p>
<p>			   Ended September 30,  Ended September 30,</p>
<p>					   1996    1995    1996    1995</p>
<p> Revenues			   $36,725 $30,869 $98,261 $84,725</p>
<p>Pro Forma Combined Net Income</p>
<p>  From Continuing Operations    1,421   1,270   2,942   2,627</p>
<p>Pro Forma Combined Earnings</p>
<p>  Per Share			    0.16    0.14    0.32    0.29</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding     9,080   9,080   9,080   9,080</p>
<p>NOTE - a/ Actual results of operations are not reflected in this table as the company completed its acquisitions of its operating companies on September 27, 1996, the date of the closing of the company's initial public offering.</p>
<p>Full company name is American Residential Services Inc</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
